  "decisions": [
    "Add optional selectFeeds and selected_feeds_v1; page sends an empty object and cannot provide source, origin or selections.",
    "Retain false production qualification and default-deny destination predicate; private chooser/consent assets are packaged only into the separate synthetic fixture.",
    "Unsupported browser/destination refuses before adapter custody hooks; unapproved destinations cannot learn setup/lock status from this operation.",
    "Bind document and exact destination from Chrome sender context; trusted popup documents are checked through runtime.getContexts.",
    "Capture encrypted source before trusted choice UI; reuse unchanged pure/shared controller, exact ciphertext fence and FIFO. Keep 16 real queued/in-flight slots, observed-clock rollback refusal and one outer 120-second deadline.",
    "Separate choices, privacy consent and receiving-host additive import confirmation. Return only unchanged raw FeedSection data; no authority, grants, signing or activation.",
    "Use normal-flow actions and presentation-only blank-title labels. Preserve nonblank literal text and raw source strings.",
    "Reuse cached pinned Chrome for Testing after branded Chrome refused unpacked-extension loading; no browser installation or personal profile was used."
  ],
  "scope_limits": [
    "No production enablement, accepted production destination, runtime v3 guard waiver, app repin, registry publication, signing/custody/recovery/grant change, or actual user/account/browser data.",
    "Browser positive path is a separate disposable synthetic worker and receiver using real Chrome APIs, encrypted storage, shared Wallet WASM, packaged Book Nook WASM/typed SDK and IndexedDB. It is not production host qualification.",
    "The 120-second boundary is exercised with the fixture clock; not a 120-second wall-time soak. Clock protection covers observed decreases only.",
    "No physical device, hardware keyboard, screen-reader/VoiceOver or full human accessibility qualification. Screenshots were visually inspected and accessible fallback checkbox labels were asserted.",
    "Network claim is bounded to Playwright-observed context HTTP requests; no source fetch adapter is installed or activated at the receiving host.",
    "Four existing qualified-v3-import tests remain intentionally gated/skipped. The actual v3 default import refusal was exercised in the browser.",
    "Existing session/grant protocol and source-preserving mainline controller remain unchanged; their prior qualification is not expanded by this adapter."
  ],
  "remaining_work": [
    "Independent parent review and PR publication.",
    "Explicit future production destination/host qualification with live lifecycle and consent policy before any capability enablement.",
    "Any actual accepting app integration/repin is a separate reviewed increment; Book Nook browser client remains out of this scope."
  ]
